{"seq":3,"slug":"cilium-hubble","title":"Cilium 与 Hubble 平台级可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/toolchain/cilium-hubble","wordCount":1477,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"cilium-与-hubble-平台级可观测性\">Cilium 与 Hubble 平台级可观测性</h1><p>Cilium 是基于 eBPF 构建的 Kubernetes 网络、安全与可观测性平台，2023 年从 CNCF 毕业，2024 年 Isovalent 被 Cisco 收购后进一步加速商业化。2026 年，Cilium 是 GKE、EKS Anywhere、AKS 的默认或推荐 CNI（Container Network Interface），其内置的可观测性子系统 Hubble 提供了从 L3 到 L7 的全栈流量可视化——无需 sidecar、无需应用代码修改、无需独立的 APM agent。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Cilium 代表 eBPF 从「工具」到「平台」的跃迁——它把网络转发、策略执行与遥测采集统一到同一套 eBPF 数据面，取代了 iptables 与 sidecar 代理。对其可观测性层 Hubble 而言，关键设计是「从数据面直接采集、不做额外抓包」：每个流事件都携带 Cilium 的 security identity，因此天然具备 Pod 级身份标注，Service Map 也能从真实流量自动推导。理解 Cilium 的重点在于把握其分层代价——L3/L4 近乎零成本，L7 解析按需开启并逐级增加开销，这正是渐进式启用策略的依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cilium-架构概览\">Cilium 架构概览</h2><p>Cilium 的核心设计是将网络数据面从 iptables 迁移到 eBPF——每个节点运行一个 Cilium agent（DaemonSet），agent 编译并加载 eBPF 程序到内核的 XDP、tc、socket 等 hook 点，实现数据包的高速转发、策略执行和遥测采集。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Node[&quot;Kubernetes 节点&quot;]&#10;        subgraph Kernel[&quot;Linux 内核&quot;]&#10;            X[XDP 程序] --&gt; T[tc 程序]&#10;            T --&gt; S[Socket 程序]&#10;            S --&gt; L[LSM 程序]&#10;        end&#10;        A[Cilium Agent] --&gt;|编译加载| Kernel&#10;        A --&gt; M[eBPF Maps]&#10;        H[Hubble Observer] --&gt; M&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Control[&quot;控制面&quot;]&#10;        O[Cilium Operator]&#10;        HR[Hubble Relay]&#10;        HU[Hubble UI]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; O&#10;    H --&gt; HR&#10;    HR --&gt; HU\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Node[\"Kubernetes 节点\"]\n        subgraph Kernel[\"Linux 内核\"]\n            X[XDP 程序] --&gt; T[tc 程序]\n            T --&gt; S[Socket 程序]\n            S --&gt; L[LSM 程序]\n        end\n        A[Cilium Agent] --&gt;|编译加载| Kernel\n        A --&gt; M[eBPF Maps]\n        H[Hubble Observer] --&gt; M\n    end\n    subgraph Control[\"控制面\"]\n        O[Cilium Operator]\n        HR[Hubble Relay]\n        HU[Hubble UI]\n    end\n    A --&gt; O\n    H --&gt; HR\n    HR --&gt; HU</pre><h3 id=\"核心组件职责\">核心组件职责</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>部署方式</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cilium Agent</td>\n<td>DaemonSet（每节点一个）</td>\n<td>eBPF 程序管理、策略编译、身份分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cilium Operator</td>\n<td>Deployment（集群级）</td>\n<td>IP 分配、CRD 协调、垃圾回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hubble Observer</td>\n<td>Agent 内嵌</td>\n<td>从 eBPF map 读取流事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hubble Relay</td>\n<td>Deployment</td>\n<td>聚合全集群 Hubble 数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hubble UI</td>\n<td>Deployment</td>\n<td>Web 可视化界面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hubble CLI</td>\n<td>客户端二进制</td>\n<td>命令行流查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"hubble-可观测性能力\">Hubble 可观测性能力</h2><p>Hubble 是 Cilium 的可观测性层，它直接从 eBPF 数据面采集流事件，无需额外的数据包捕获或代理注入。每个经过 Cilium 数据面的数据包/连接都被记录为结构化的 flow event。</p>\n<h3 id=\"flow-event-数据模型\">Flow Event 数据模型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// Hubble flow 包含的核心信息&#10;struct flow {&#10;    // 身份层&#10;    struct identity source;        // 源 Pod/Service 身份&#10;    struct identity destination;   // 目标 Pod/Service 身份&#10;&#10;    // 网络层&#10;    uint32_t src_ip, dst_ip;&#10;    uint16_t src_port, dst_port;&#10;    uint8_t  protocol;             // TCP/UDP/ICMP&#10;&#10;    // 策略层&#10;    enum verdict verdict;          // FORWARDED/DROPPED/AUDIT&#10;    uint32_t drop_reason;          // 丢弃原因码&#10;    uint32_t policy_id;            // 匹配的策略 ID&#10;&#10;    // L7 层（开启 L7 可视化时）&#10;    struct l7_info {&#10;        enum l7_type type;         // HTTP/gRPC/DNS/Kafka&#10;        char method[16];           // GET/POST/...&#10;        char url[256];             // 请求路径&#10;        uint32_t status_code;      // HTTP 状态码&#10;        uint64_t latency_ns;       // 请求延迟&#10;    } l7;&#10;&#10;    // 时间与上下文&#10;    uint64_t timestamp;&#10;    char node_name[64];&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Hubble flow 包含的核心信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 身份层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> identity source;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 源 Pod/Service 身份</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> identity destination;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 目标 Pod/Service 身份</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 网络层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> src_ip, dst_ip;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint16_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> src_port, dst_port;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  protocol;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             // TCP/UDP/ICMP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 策略层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    enum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> verdict verdict;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // FORWARDED/DROPPED/AUDIT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> drop_reason;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // 丢弃原因码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> policy_id;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // 匹配的策略 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // L7 层（开启 L7 可视化时）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> l7_info {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        enum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> l7_type type;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         // HTTP/gRPC/DNS/Kafka</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        char</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> method</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           // GET/POST/...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        char</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             // 请求路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> status_code;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // HTTP 状态码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        uint64_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> latency_ns;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 请求延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } l7;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 时间与上下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint64_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timestamp;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> node_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"查询示例\">查询示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看命名空间 production 的所有 HTTP 流量&#10;hubble observe --namespace production --protocol http&#10;&#10;# 过滤被策略丢弃的流量&#10;hubble observe --verdict DROPPED&#10;&#10;# 查看特定服务的出站连接&#10;hubble observe --from-pod production/api-server&#10;&#10;# DNS 查询追踪&#10;hubble observe --protocol dns --namespace kube-system&#10;&#10;# 查看 HTTP 错误（4xx/5xx）&#10;hubble observe --http-status 400-599\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看命名空间 production 的所有 HTTP 流量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hubble</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> observe</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --protocol</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 过滤被策略丢弃的流量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hubble</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> observe</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --verdict</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> DROPPED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看特定服务的出站连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hubble</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> observe</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --from-pod</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production/api-server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># DNS 查询追踪</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hubble</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> observe</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --protocol</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dns</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> kube-system</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看 HTTP 错误（4xx/5xx）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hubble</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> observe</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --http-status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 400-599</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"l7-协议可视化\">L7 协议可视化</h2><p>Cilium 默认工作在 L3/L4 层（高性能，最小开销）。通过 CiliumNetworkPolicy 的 L7 规则或全局配置，可以选择性地对特定流量启用 L7 解析。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>支持深度</th>\n<th>提取信息</th>\n<th>启用方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HTTP/1.1</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>Method, URL, Status, Headers</td>\n<td>L7 policy 或 annotation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP/2</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>同上 + Stream ID</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gRPC</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>Service, Method, Status Code</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNS</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>Query name, Type, Response</td>\n<td>默认启用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kafka</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>Topic, API Key, Error Code</td>\n<td>L7 policy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MySQL</td>\n<td>基础</td>\n<td>Query type, Table</td>\n<td>实验性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# CiliumNetworkPolicy 启用 L7 HTTP 可视化&#10;apiVersion: cilium.io/v2&#10;kind: CiliumNetworkPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: api-l7-visibility&#10;  namespace: production&#10;spec:&#10;  endpointSelector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: api-server&#10;  ingress:&#10;    - fromEndpoints:&#10;        - matchLabels:&#10;            app: frontend&#10;      toPorts:&#10;        - ports:&#10;            - port: &#39;8080&#39;&#10;              protocol: TCP&#10;          rules:&#10;            http:&#10;              - method: &#39;GET&#39;&#10;                path: &#39;/api/.*&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CiliumNetworkPolicy 启用 L7 HTTP 可视化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cilium.io/v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CiliumNetworkPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api-l7-visibility</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  endpointSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api-server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ingress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fromEndpoints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">frontend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      toPorts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'8080'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">TCP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">method</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GET'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/.*'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"hubble-metrics-与-prometheus-集成\">Hubble Metrics 与 Prometheus 集成</h2><p>Hubble 将流事件聚合为 Prometheus 指标，覆盖网络可观测性的核心需求：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Cilium Helm values：启用 Hubble metrics&#10;hubble:&#10;  enabled: true&#10;  relay:&#10;    enabled: true&#10;  ui:&#10;    enabled: true&#10;  metrics:&#10;    enabled:&#10;      - dns&#10;      - drop&#10;      - tcp&#10;      - flow&#10;      - icmp&#10;      - http&#10;    serviceMonitor:&#10;      enabled: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Cilium Helm values：启用 Hubble metrics</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">hubble</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  relay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ui</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dns</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">drop</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tcp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">flow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">icmp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    serviceMonitor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键 Prometheus 指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标名</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>hubble_flows_processed_total</code></td>\n<td>Counter</td>\n<td>处理的总流数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hubble_drop_total</code></td>\n<td>Counter</td>\n<td>丢弃的包数（按原因标签）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hubble_tcp_flags_total</code></td>\n<td>Counter</td>\n<td>TCP 标志位统计（SYN/FIN/RST）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hubble_dns_queries_total</code></td>\n<td>Counter</td>\n<td>DNS 查询数（按 query/rcode）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hubble_http_requests_total</code></td>\n<td>Counter</td>\n<td>HTTP 请求数（按 method/status）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hubble_http_request_duration_seconds</code></td>\n<td>Histogram</td>\n<td>HTTP 请求延迟分布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"service-map-自动生成\">Service Map 自动生成</h2><p>Hubble UI 的核心能力是<strong>自动生成服务依赖拓扑图</strong>——无需手动配置、无需 service mesh 注册，纯粹从 eBPF 观测到的实际网络流量推导出服务间调用关系。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Namespace: production&#10;        FE[frontend] --&gt;|HTTP GET /api| API[api-server]&#10;        API --&gt;|gRPC| AUTH[auth-service]&#10;        API --&gt;|TCP 5432| DB[(postgres)]&#10;        API --&gt;|TCP 6379| CACHE[(redis)]&#10;        FE --&gt;|DNS| DNS[kube-dns]&#10;        API --&gt;|DNS| DNS&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Namespace: production\n        FE[frontend] --&gt;|HTTP GET /api| API[api-server]\n        API --&gt;|gRPC| AUTH[auth-service]\n        API --&gt;|TCP 5432| DB[(postgres)]\n        API --&gt;|TCP 6379| CACHE[(redis)]\n        FE --&gt;|DNS| DNS[kube-dns]\n        API --&gt;|DNS| DNS\n    end</pre><p>Service Map 的数据来源：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>身份解析</strong>：Cilium 为每个 Pod 分配 security identity（基于 labels），流事件携带源/目标身份</li>\n<li><strong>流聚合</strong>：按 (source_identity, dest_identity, dest_port, protocol) 聚合流事件</li>\n<li><strong>协议标注</strong>：L7 解析后标注实际应用层协议</li>\n<li><strong>拓扑渲染</strong>：Hubble UI 将聚合数据渲染为可交互的依赖图</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"与-opentelemetry-集成\">与 OpenTelemetry 集成</h2><p>Cilium 1.15+ 和 Grafana Beyla 提供了 eBPF 到 OpenTelemetry 的桥接——将 eBPF 采集的网络事件转换为 OTLP 格式的 trace、metric 和 log。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[eBPF 数据面] --&gt; B[Hubble flow events]&#10;    B --&gt; C[OpenTelemetry Collector]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Tempo / Jaeger]&#10;    C --&gt; E[Prometheus]&#10;    C --&gt; F[Loki]&#10;&#10;    G[Grafana Beyla] --&gt; C&#10;    G --&gt;|uprobe| H[应用进程]\">flowchart LR\n    A[eBPF 数据面] --&gt; B[Hubble flow events]\n    B --&gt; C[OpenTelemetry Collector]\n    C --&gt; D[Tempo / Jaeger]\n    C --&gt; E[Prometheus]\n    C --&gt; F[Loki]\n\n    G[Grafana Beyla] --&gt; C\n    G --&gt;|uprobe| H[应用进程]</pre><p>Grafana Beyla 是独立于 Cilium 的 eBPF 可观测性工具，通过 uprobe 自动检测 Go、Java、Node.js、Python、.NET、Rust 服务并生成 OTLP span：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Hubble (Cilium)</th>\n<th>Grafana Beyla</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>观测层</td>\n<td>L3-L7（网络视角）</td>\n<td>L7（应用视角）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署方式</td>\n<td>Cilium Agent 内嵌</td>\n<td>独立 DaemonSet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖</td>\n<td>需要 Cilium CNI</td>\n<td>独立于 CNI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trace 生成</td>\n<td>网络 span（连接级）</td>\n<td>应用 span（请求级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言覆盖</td>\n<td>协议级（语言无关）</td>\n<td>需要检测运行时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"生产部署最佳实践\">生产部署最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"渐进式启用策略\">渐进式启用策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>启用范围</th>\n<th>开销</th>\n<th>获得能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Phase 1</td>\n<td>Hubble flow（L3/L4）</td>\n<td>&lt; 1% CPU</td>\n<td>连接拓扑、丢包分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Phase 2</td>\n<td>DNS metrics</td>\n<td>+ 0.5%</td>\n<td>DNS 延迟、失败率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Phase 3</td>\n<td>TCP metrics</td>\n<td>+ 0.5%</td>\n<td>RTT、重传、连接状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Phase 4</td>\n<td>HTTP L7（关键服务）</td>\n<td>+ 1-3%</td>\n<td>请求延迟、错误率、路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Phase 5</td>\n<td>全量 L7</td>\n<td>+ 3-5%</td>\n<td>完整 service map</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"资源规划\">资源规划</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Cilium Agent 资源配置（生产推荐）&#10;resources:&#10;  limits:&#10;    cpu: &#39;2&#39;&#10;    memory: &#39;2Gi&#39;&#10;  requests:&#10;    cpu: &#39;500m&#39;&#10;    memory: &#39;512Mi&#39;&#10;&#10;# Hubble Relay&#10;resources:&#10;  limits:&#10;    cpu: &#39;1&#39;&#10;    memory: &#39;1Gi&#39;&#10;  requests:&#10;    cpu: &#39;100m&#39;&#10;    memory: &#39;256Mi&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Cilium Agent 资源配置（生产推荐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2Gi'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'500m'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'512Mi'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Hubble Relay</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1Gi'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'100m'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'256Mi'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"数据保留与采样\">数据保留与采样</h3><p>Hubble 默认在内存中保留最近的 flow 事件（通过 ring buffer 实现），不做持久化。对于需要历史查询的场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>短期（分钟级）</strong>：Hubble Observer 内存 ring buffer，默认 4096 events/node</li>\n<li><strong>中期（小时级）</strong>：导出到 OpenTelemetry Collector，存储在 Tempo/Loki</li>\n<li><strong>长期（天级）</strong>：聚合为 Prometheus 指标，保留 15-30 天</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>平台定位</strong>：Cilium 用 eBPF 统一网络转发、安全策略与遥测，取代 iptables，是主流托管 K8s 的默认/推荐 CNI</li>\n<li><strong>Hubble 数据源</strong>：直接从 eBPF 数据面采集 flow event，天然携带 security identity，无需抓包或代理注入</li>\n<li><strong>L7 按需启用</strong>：默认 L3/L4（近乎零成本），通过 CiliumNetworkPolicy 或 annotation 对指定流量开启 HTTP/gRPC/Kafka 解析</li>\n<li><strong>指标与拓扑</strong>：流事件聚合为 Prometheus 指标，Hubble UI 从真实流量自动生成 Service Map</li>\n<li><strong>渐进式策略</strong>：L3/L4 flow → DNS → TCP → HTTP L7 → 全量 L7，逐级增加开销（&lt; 1% 到 3-5%）</li>\n<li><strong>与 OpenTelemetry 集成</strong>：flow event 可转为 OTLP；Grafana Beyla 则从应用视角通过 uprobe 生成请求级 span</li>\n<li><strong>数据保留</strong>：内存 ring buffer 保留分钟级，导出到 Tempo/Loki 可达小时级，聚合为指标可保留天级</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"bcc-bpftrace\">BCC 与 bpftrace</a> 适用于 Cilium 未覆盖场景的临时深度诊断；<a href=\"libbpf-co-re\">libbpf 与 CO-RE</a> 是 Cilium 数据面的底层技术基础。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Cilium 与 Hubble 平台级可观测性","id":"cilium-与-hubble-平台级可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Cilium 架构概览","id":"cilium-架构概览"},{"level":3,"text":"核心组件职责","id":"核心组件职责"},{"level":2,"text":"Hubble 可观测性能力","id":"hubble-可观测性能力"},{"level":3,"text":"Flow Event 数据模型","id":"flow-event-数据模型"},{"level":3,"text":"查询示例","id":"查询示例"},{"level":2,"text":"L7 协议可视化","id":"l7-协议可视化"},{"level":2,"text":"Hubble Metrics 与 Prometheus 集成","id":"hubble-metrics-与-prometheus-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"Service Map 自动生成","id":"service-map-自动生成"},{"level":2,"text":"与 OpenTelemetry 集成","id":"与-opentelemetry-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"生产部署最佳实践","id":"生产部署最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"渐进式启用策略","id":"渐进式启用策略"},{"level":3,"text":"资源规划","id":"资源规划"},{"level":3,"text":"数据保留与采样","id":"数据保留与采样"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"libbpf 与 CO-RE 生产级开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/toolchain/libbpf-co-re"},"next":{"title":"eBPF 在 Kubernetes 中的部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/production/ebpf-kubernetes"}}